rence)\n- 28 fixed scenario cases (stdout + stderr + exit code)\n- ~13,500 randomized fuzz programs across multiple seeds/distributions\n- 10 stdin edge cases: >4095-byte lines, tokens straddling the fgets boundary, embedded NUL bytes, `\\v`/`\\f`, CRLF, whitespace-only, no trailing newline, leading zeros/signs, hex-like tokens, overflow values\n- Byte-exact `cmp` checks (confirming trailing-newline fidelity) on representative cases + 2,500 bounded fuzz cases\n\nEvery comparison passed with zero mismatches (argv[0] path differences were neutralized by invoking both binaries via identically-named symlinks)."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":718,"cache_read_input_tokens":84596,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":718,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b24a50fb-a4bc-4448-876b-64f971966e95","uuid":"accbb9d5-54e8-4e01-8afa-f78401f4d9a2","timestamp":"2026-08-19T17:30:45.711Z"}
